<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When I feel the touch of Your hand upon my life,</l><l>I sense the flow of life flowing rich and free;</l><l>When You wipe away every tear in my eyes,</l><l>Sorrow has depart’d, behold a smiling face!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
